Dwight has made a list of every one of Jim and Pam's female family members and is going to break down their eligibility, sort of.
德怀特列出了吉姆和帕姆所有女性家长的名单，并打算逐一分析她们的单身状态，差不多就是这样。

1008
00:51:18.400 --> 00:51:25.260
Well, if you count whether or not they've sold their bicycle online as a dating status.
嗯，如果你把她们有没有在网上卖过自行车也算作一种恋爱状态的话。

1009
00:51:25.780 --> 00:51:26.840
Yeah, exactly.
